# See https://help.github.com/ignore-files/ for more about ignoring files.

# directories
coverage
dist
node_modules

# misc
.DS_Store
.idea
*.log*

# NOTE: references/ and packages/*/src/generated/ are deliberately NOT ignored.
# The vendored ODNI packages and the code generated from them are committed
# on purpose — see docs/adr/0003-vocabularies-are-generated-and-committed.md

# --- references/ ---------------------------------------------------------
# The vendored ODNI packages are committed (ADR-0003), but only the parts
# codegen, harvest and the rules harvester actually read, plus the XSL and
# Schematron the source comments cite as normative. Everything below is either
# a second encoding of data kept elsewhere, or documentation for humans.

# IC-GENC ships the geopolitical entity register that ISMCAT already enumerates.
# Nothing reads it.
references/IC-GENC-Public-Convenience-2022-DEC-Public-Light/

# RELAX NG restates the XSDs; CSV restates the CVE JSON.
references/**/*.rng
references/**/*.rnc
references/**/*.csv

# Human documentation and packaging metadata.
references/**/*.pdf
references/**/*.png
# Exception: DoDM 5200.01-V2 is the normative source for banner syntax and the
# order of marking categories, which the XSL only implements. Source comments
# cite it, so it is tracked for the same reason the XSL and Schematron are.
!references/520001m_vol2.pdf
!references/Cleared-CUI-Training-Aid-Markings-2024.pdf
references/**/*.html
references/**/*.xhtml
references/**/*.md5
references/**/*.properties
